  <ns0:Ontology rdf:about="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl">
    <ns117:rights rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns117="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Copyright POSC Caesar Association</ns117:rights>
    <ns118:created rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns118="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">2026-05-09</ns118:created>
    <ns119:creator rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0009-0003-7263-9946" xmlns:ns119="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns120:license rdf:resource="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" xmlns:ns120="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns121:modified rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns121="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">2026-06-01</ns121:modified>
    <ns122:publisher rdf:resource="https://www.posccaesar.org/" xmlns:ns122="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns123:title rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns123="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">Quality Property Aspect Extension Ontology OWL</ns123:title>
    <ns124:preferredNamespacePrefix rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns124="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/">lis-ext-qual-owl</ns124:preferredNamespacePrefix>
    <ns125:preferredNamespaceUri rdf:resource="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-aspect/0.1.0/rdl/" xmlns:ns125="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" />
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Quality Property Aspect Extension Ontology OWL</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/plm/ont/core" />
    <ns0:imports rdf:resource="http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/lis14/ont/core" />
    <ns0:imports rdf:resource="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/" />
    <ns0:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl" />
    <ns0:versionInfo rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">0.1.0</ns0:versionInfo>
    <ns126:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns126="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">Defines property aspects of lis:Quality as OWL ontology
Background:
The Industrial Data Ontology (IDO) already establishes a clear distinction between properties (lis:Quality) and values (lis:QualityDatum).
Building on this foundation, this ontology introduces aspects to further refine the semantics of properties (lis:Quality).
Aspects enable a more granular and standardized representation of property-related information,
allowing for precise classification and contextualization of properties (lis:Quality) that describe the property itself,
independent of its specific values.

This ontology is inspired by and extends the plm ontology from POSC Caesar Association (PCA).</ns126:definition>
  </ns0:Ontology>
  <ns0:Ontology rdf:about="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl">
    <ns127:rights rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns127="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Copyright POSC Caesar Association</ns127:rights>
    <ns128:created rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns128="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">2026-05-07</ns128:created>
    <ns129:creator rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0009-0003-7263-9946" xmlns:ns129="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns130:license rdf:resource="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" xmlns:ns130="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns131:modified rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns131="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">2026-06-01</ns131:modified>
    <ns132:publisher rdf:resource="https://www.posccaesar.org/" xmlns:ns132="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns133:title rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns133="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">QualityDatum Value Aspect Extension Ontology OWL</ns133:title>
    <ns134:preferredNamespacePrefix rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns134="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/">lis-ext-qd-asp-owl</ns134:preferredNamespacePrefix>
    <ns135:preferredNamespaceUri rdf:resource="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-aspect/0.1.0/rdl/" xmlns:ns135="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" />
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">QualityDatum Value Aspect Extension Ontology OWL</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/plm/ont/core" />
    <ns0:imports rdf:resource="http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/lis14/ont/core" />
    <ns0:imports rdf:resource="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/" />
    <ns0:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl" />
    <ns0:versionInfo rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">0.1.0</ns0:versionInfo>
    <ns136:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns136="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">Defines value aspects of lis:QualityDatum as OWL ontology
Background:
The Industrial Data Ontology (IDO) already establishes a clear distinction between properties (lis:Quality) and values (lis:QualityDatum).
Building on this foundation, this ontology introduces aspects to further refine the semantics of values (lis:QualityDatum).
Aspects enable a more granular and standardized representation of value-related information,
allowing for precise classification and contextualization of characteristics that describe specific values (lis:QualityDatum),
such as ranges, thresholds, or other value-specific attributes.

This ontology aligns with IEC 61360-1, particularly its LEVEL_TYPE concept (MIN, NOM, TYP, MAX),
which is now implemented more flexibly by representing each role as a separate class and
supporting all four values to enable precise semantic composition of value aspects.

This ontology is inspired by and extends the plm ontology from POSC Caesar Association (PCA).</ns136:definition>
  </ns0:Ontology>
  <ns0:Ontology rdf:about="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-data-type/0.1.0/ont/core-owl">
    <ns137:rights rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns137="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Copyright POSC Caesar Association</ns137:rights>
    <ns138:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0009-0003-7263-9946" xmlns:ns138="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns139:created rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns139="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">2021-02-15</ns139:created>
    <ns140:creator rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0009-0005-9639-4327" xmlns:ns140="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns141:license rdf:resource="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" xmlns:ns141="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns142:modified rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns142="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">2026-06-01</ns142:modified>
    <ns143:publisher rdf:resource="https://www.posccaesar.org/" xmlns:ns143="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" />
    <ns144:title rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns144="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">QualityDatum Data Type Extension Ontology OWL</ns144:title>
    <ns145:preferredNamespacePrefix rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns145="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/">lis-ext-qd-dt-owl</ns145:preferredNamespacePrefix>
    <ns146:preferredNamespaceUri rdf:resource="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-data-type/0.1.0/rdl/" xmlns:ns146="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" />
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">QualityDatum Data Type Extension Ontology OWL</rdfs:label>
    <ns0:imports rdf:resource="http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/lis14/ont/core" />
    <ns0:imports rdf:resource="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/" />
    <ns0:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-data-type/0.1.0/ont/core-owl" />
    <ns0:versionInfo rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">0.1.0</ns0:versionInfo>
    <ns147:definition rdf:datatype="&xsd;string" xmlns:ns147="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">Defines basic data types of lis:QualityDatum in accordance with IEC61360-1 as OWL ontology
Background:
The Industrial Data Ontology (IDO) already establishes a clear distinction between properties (lis:Quality) and values (lis:QualityDatum).
This ontology extends the data type modeling for lis:QualityDatum by defining specific data types in accordance with IEC 61360-1.
The class names and labels are oriented towards the corresponding XSD data types to ensure consistency with standard data representations and interoperability.
This ontology aligns with the data type definitions in IEC 61360-1. </ns147:definition>
  </ns0:Ontology>
  <ns0:Ontology rdf:about="https://posccaesar.org/ontology/qudt-ido-alignment/0.1.0/ont/align">
